# For Aspire, use the API HTTPS endpoint from the dashboard.
@hostAddress = https://localhost:7064
@riskAccountId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

GET {{hostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# Record a password reset. Expected: 201 with eventId.
# Each send inserts another event into the existing database.
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "accountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "eventType": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T15:00:00Z"
}

### Empty account ID: expected 400, no event inserted.
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "eventType": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T15:00:00Z"
}


### Retrieve events for the sample account
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events?accountId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111&fromInclusive=2026-10-29T00:00:00Z&toExclusive=2026-10-30T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Risk scenario 1/3: password reset. Send these three POSTs in order.
# Repeating a POST inserts another event. Use a new riskAccountId for a fresh scenario.
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{riskAccountId}}",
  "eventType": 1,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T10:00:00Z"
}

### Risk scenario 2/3: MFA enrolment five minutes later
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{riskAccountId}}",
  "eventType": 2,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T10:05:00Z"
}

### Risk scenario 3/3: contact change twenty minutes after reset
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{riskAccountId}}",
  "eventType": 3,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T10:20:00Z"
}

### Assess complete sequence: 200, totalScore 80, riskBand High, ATO-001 and three evidence IDs
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/risk-assessments/{{riskAccountId}}?fromInclusive=2026-10-29T10:00:00Z&toExclusive=2026-10-29T11:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Exclude the contact change: 200, totalScore 0, riskBand Low, matches []
# The query end is exclusive; the contact event at 10:20 is excluded.
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/risk-assessments/{{riskAccountId}}?fromInclusive=2026-10-29T10:00:00Z&toExclusive=2026-10-29T10:20:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Reversed window: 400 validation problem
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/risk-assessments/{{riskAccountId}}?fromInclusive=2026-10-29T11:00:00Z&toExclusive=2026-10-29T10:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Bank details changed — expect 201
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "eventType": 5,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T12:00:00Z"
}

### Sale requested 15 minutes later — expect 201
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/account-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "eventType": 6,
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-29T12:15:00Z"
}

### Assess — expect totalScore 60, riskBand Medium, rule PAY-001
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/risk-assessments/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333?fromInclusive=2026-10-29T12:00:00Z&toExclusive=2026-10-29T14:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Run and save an assessment for the ATO sample account
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "fromInclusive": "2026-10-29T10:00:00Z",
  "toExclusive": "2026-10-29T11:00:00Z"
}

### Retrieve the saved assessment — paste the returned assessmentId
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/assessments/1C3EDB4F-774E-4029-AA69-55C7AD0F3170
Accept: application/json

### Latest 50 saved assessments, newest first
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/assessments/accounts/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Accept: application/json

### Generate an AI explanation of a saved assessment
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/assessments/1C3EDB4F-774E-4029-AA69-55C7AD0F3170/investigations
Accept: application/json

### Find accounts sharing a device — expect account 3333...
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/accounts/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/graph/shared-devices
Accept: application/json

### Separate device — expect []
GET {{hostAddress}}/api/accounts/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444/graph/shared-devices
Accept: application/json